  "locale:104139 [quest_objective | Highroad Junction | Chef: Fireworks Frenzy!] 'Ranger Ricardo will take the ingredients to Auguste, but first he needs your help. The fireworks that have shown up in Highroad Junction are a fire hazard! Help'",
  "locale:104140 [quest_dialog | Highroad Junction | Chef: Fireworks Frenzy!] \"You did it! You found the fireworks!<BR><BR>Thanks for the help, [*player*]. I'll make sure Auguste gets his delivery now.\"",
  "locale:104141 [quest_dialog | Highroad Junction | Chef: Perry's Pastures] \"Auguste is a great chef, but the secret to his success is the ingredients he uses. That's why you should check out <font color='#D9781A'>Perry's Pastures</font>\"",
  "locale:104142 [quest_title | Highroad Junction | Chef: Perry's Pastures] \"Chef: Perry's Pastures\"",
  "locale:104143 [quest_objective | Highroad Junction | Chef: Perry's Pastures] \"Find Perry at Perry's Pastures, north of Highroad Junction, and learn about harvesting.\"",
  "locale:104144 [quest_dialog | Highroad Junction | Chef: Perry's Pastures] 'Why, hello there! Ranger Ricardo sent you, did he?<BR><BR>I could certainly use the help!'",
  "locale:104145 [quest_dialog | Highroad Junction | Brawler: Restless Rumors] \"I've heard that Harold's twin brother, <font color='#D9781A'>Gerold</font>, is also having trouble with some dangerous animals.<BR><BR>If you want to lend him a\"",
  "locale:104146 [quest_title | Snowhill | Brawler: Restless Rumors] 'Brawler: Restless Rumors'",
  "locale:104147 [quest_objective | Snowhill | Brawler: Restless Rumors] \"Harold's twin brother Gerold is having some trouble with wolves south of Snowhill. Find him and see what you can do to help!\"",
  "locale:104148 [quest_dialog | Snowhill | Brawler: Restless Rumors] \"Hi there stranger! Say, you wouldn't happen to have any experience wrestling with dangerous animals would you?<BR><BR>Hey, that's great news! I could really use\"",
  "locale:104149 [quest_objective | Snowhill | Brawler: Growler Encroachment] \"Frostfang wolves are dangerous! They've wandered too far from their lair, and I need to push them back.<BR><BR>Will you help me by <font color='#D9781A'>defeati\"",
  "locale:104150 [quest_title | Snowhill | Brawler: Growler Encroachment] 'Brawler: Growler Encroachment'",
  "locale:104151 [quest_objective | Snowhill | Brawler: Growler Encroachment] 'The local Frostfang population has been growing bolder, and many can now be found amongst the fields south of Snowhill. This could become very dangerous if some'",
  "locale:104152 [quest_dialog | Snowhill | Brawler: Growler Encroachment] \"Nice job! Thanks to you, the Growlers won't be as likely to wander down here again.\"",
  "locale:104153 [quest_dialog | Snowhill | The Growler Report] \"We need to report this wolf problem to Snowhill.<BR><BR>Will you <font color='#D9781A'>talk to Tevin</font> about it? He's at the town hall, near the center of \"",
  "locale:104154 [quest_title | Snowhill | The Growler Report] 'Brawler: The Growler Report'",
  "locale:104155 [quest_objective | Snowhill | The Growler Report] 'Gerold has asked you to deliver his report on the Growler situation to Assistant Mayor Tevin in Snowhill.'",
  "locale:104156 [quest_dialog | Snowhill | The Growler Report] \"You have a report on some Frostfang activity?<BR><BR>Thank you! This information will be very useful. I'll make sure the Mayor sees it as soon as possible.\""
 ],
