  "locale:116488 [quest_objective | - | Caitlyn Gravefog] \"Now that you know how to brawl you can <font color = '#D9781A'>fight the wraith</font> in my <font color = '#D9781A'>graveyard</font>. It's really creepy, so pl\"",
  "locale:116492 [quest_objective | - | Chef: Gavin Gone Missing] \"My assistant is gathering ingredients for me, but he's late.<BR><BR>Can you <font color = '#D9781A'>look for</font> him on the road heading south? His name is <\"",
