  "locale:116494 [quest_objective | - | Chef: Gavin Gone Missing] \"Helena's assistant, Gavin Greenpetal has been gone for quite some time. Search for him on the road heading south out of Stillwater Crossing.\"",
  "locale:116495 [quest_dialog | - | Chef: Gavin Gone Missing] \"Thank goodness, a friendly face! I've had a terrible day!\"",
  "locale:116496 [quest_objective | - | Chef: Harvest Hiccup!] \"Robgoblins <font color = '#D9781A'>scattered</font> my <font color = '#D9781A'>ingredients</font> all over the place! Can you help me <font color = '#D9781A'>pi\"",
  "locale:116497 [quest_title | - | Chef: Harvest Hiccup!] 'Chef: Harvest Hiccup!'",
  "locale:116498 [quest_objective | - | Chef: Harvest Hiccup!] \"Robgoblins have tossed Gavin's freshly harvested ingredients all over the place! He can't go back to Helena empty handed, so he's asked you to help him pick the\"",
  "locale:116499 [quest_dialog | - | Chef: Harvest Hiccup!] 'My ingredients! You found them all!<BR><BR>Thank you for helping me! Now I can go back to Helena.'",
  "locale:116500 [quest_objective | - | Honey] \"Helena has me gather ingredients from the <font color = '#D9781A'>Queensfields Farm</font> all the time, because they really are the best around. You should che\"",
