  "locale:94246 [npc_dialog | Cobblestone Village | Ricky Danger] \"You meet the coolest people here in Cobblestone Village!<BR><BR><font color= '#D9781A'>Ricky Danger</font> is a famous Kart Driver.<BR><BR>Go say hi!\"",
  "locale:94247 [quest_title | Cobblestone Village | Ricky Danger] 'Introduce Yourself'",
  "locale:94248 [quest_objective | Cobblestone Village | Ricky Danger] 'Introduce yourself to Ricky Danger in Cobblestone Village.'",
  "locale:94250 [quest_dialog | - | Pet Trainer: Pet Basics] \"Pets are really fun, but you should know how to take care of them if you plan on owning one. <font color= '#D9781A'>Would you like me to give you lessons</font>\"",
  "locale:94251 [quest_title | - | Pet Trainer: Pet Basics] 'Pet Trainer: Pet Basics'",
  "locale:94252 [quest_objective | - | Pet Trainer: Pet Basics] 'Majorie has offered to give you an introductory course on pet training. Her dog Spot will help you complete the lesson.'",
  "locale:94253 [quest_dialog | - | Pet Trainer: Pet Basics] 'Great job, [*player*]!<BR><BR>Just give Spot a nudge any time you want to play the tutorial again.'",
  "locale:94254 [quest_dialog | - | Call the Crew!] \"I can't figure out where my pit crew boss is. I need Shakey to get this kart fixed!<BR><BR>Can you head south to the <font color='#D9781A'>Wildwood Speedway</fo\"",
  "locale:94255 [quest_title | - | Call the Crew!] 'Call the Crew!'",
  "locale:94256 [quest_objective | - | Call the Crew!] \"Ricky Danger crashed his kart again, and this time his pit crew boss, Shakey, doesn't want to help him! Head to the Wildwood Speedway and see if you can convinc\"",
  "locale:94257 [quest_dialog | - | Call the Crew!] \"Shakey's going to fix my kart? That's great!<BR><BR>I think I've learned an important lesson today, [*player*]. Just because I CAN drive fast doesn't mean I SHO\"",
  "locale:94258 [quest_dialog | - | Call the Crew!] \"All right, all right. <font color='#D9781A'>Tell Ricky I'll come fix his car</font>. This is the last time, I swear, unless he learns how to drive!<BR><BR>You l\"",
  "locale:94259 [quest_title | Cobblestone Village | NOT LIVE - Raceway Regulators | FLAG not_live: title starts NOT LIVE] 'NOT LIVE - Raceway Regulators'",
  "locale:94260 [quest_objective | Cobblestone Village | Raceway Regulators | FLAG not_live: part of NOT LIVE quest Raceway Regulators] 'Learn about racing from Johnny Thunder and Demolition Derby Driver from Mad Jack, at the Wildwood Speedway. Return to Ricky Danger in Cobblestone Village when y'",
  "locale:94261 [quest_dialog | - | Call the Crew!] \"Shakey's going to fix my car? Great! I promise I'll be more careful next time.<BR><BR>Here's something for your trouble.\"",
  "locale:94262 [quest_dialog | Cobblestone Village | Back for More] \"Hey, <font color= '#D9781A'>Samantha</font> was looking for you. I think she has <font color= '#D9781A'>a few more quests</font>!\"",
  "locale:94263 [quest_title | Cobblestone Village | Back for More] 'Back for More'",
  "locale:94264 [quest_objective | Cobblestone Village | Back for More] 'Find out what Samantha in Cobblestone Village wanted to talk to you about.'",
  "locale:94265 [npc_dialog | - | -] 'Hello again! Some fun stuff is going on right now.<BR><BR>Talk to me again if you want to hear about it!'",
  "locale:94267 [other | - | Demo-Derby tutorial | FLAG dev_note: internal build label] 'Cobblestone Village - Demo-Derby tutorial (v1)'",
  "locale:94271 [other | - | Demo-Derby tutorial | FLAG dev_note: internal build label] 'Cobblestone Village - Demo-Derby tutorial (v2)'",
  "locale:94274 [quest_dialog | Cobblestone Village | Chef: Cobblestone Village Cafe] \"Those brawlers just love my <font color= '#D9781A'>Spiralmint Steak</font>! It must be because of my secret blend of herbs and spices.<BR><BR>I'll teach you how\"",
  "locale:94275 [quest_title | Cobblestone Village | Chef: Cobblestone Village Cafe] 'Chef: Cobblestone Village Cafe'",
  "locale:94276 [quest_objective | Cobblestone Village | Chef: Cobblestone Village Cafe] \"Orders have really been piling up for Simone's Spiralmint Steak. Those brawlers just can't get enough of it! Too bad the increased demand is more than Simone ca\"",
  "locale:94277 [quest_dialog | Cobblestone Village | Chef: Cobblestone Village Cafe] 'Great job helping out Auguste!'",
  "locale:94278 [quest_dialog | - | Spiralmint Steak] \"Those brawlers just love my <font color= '#D9781A'>Spiralmint Steak</font>! It must be because of my secret blend of herbs and spices.<BR><BR>I'll teach you how\"",
  "locale:94282 [quest_dialog | - | Brawler: Honor Lost] \"It's all Kibler's fault. He brought Mongo to the ring. It's just not fair! Look at the size of his arms!<BR><BR>If you can <font color= '#D9781A'>beat Mongo</fo\"",
  "locale:94283 [quest_title | - | Brawler: Honor Lost] 'Brawler: Honor Lost'",
  "locale:94284 [quest_dialog | - | Brawler: Honor Lost] \"The ex-brawling champion Carlos Brazenfist is looking for a partner to help him win back his honor. Kibler's goon, Mongo, has been the undisputed king of the ri\"",
  "locale:94285 [quest_dialog | - | Brawler: Honor Lost] 'You did it! You beat Mongo!<BR><BR>Now I can hold my head up high again. Thanks, [*player*]!'",
  "locale:94290 [quest_dialog | Sacred Grove | Chef: Delivery Derailed] \"You can harvest ingredients at farms all over Sacred Grove. The closest one is Queensfields, north of here.<BR><BR>I'm waiting for a delivery from Queensfields \"",
  "locale:94291 [quest_title | Sacred Grove | Chef: Delivery Derailed] 'Chef: Delivery Derailed'",
  "locale:94292 [quest_objective | Sacred Grove | Chef: Delivery Derailed] 'Search for Jonelle on the road north of Cobblestone Village, leading to Sanctuary.'",
  "locale:94293 [quest_dialog | Sacred Grove | Chef: Delivery Derailed] 'Help! My packages have been stolen!'",
  "locale:94294 [quest_dialog | Cobblestone Village | Brawler: Building your Rep] \"You should build your reputation as a Brawler. I heard some local hooligans have been causing trouble.<BR><BR>See if <font color= '#D9781A'>Jones needs your hel\"",
  "locale:94295 [quest_title | Cobblestone Village | Brawler: Building your Rep] 'Brawler: Building your Rep'",
  "locale:94296 [quest_objective | Cobblestone Village | Brawler: Building your Rep] 'Find Jones at his makeshift camp, along the road leading east out of Cobblestone Village towards Blackspore.'",
  "locale:94297 [npc_dialog | Cobblestone Village | Jones] 'If you have business with me, then speak quickly. Hooligans are about...'",
  "locale:94298 [quest_dialog | Cobblestone Village | Chef: Package Recovery!] \"Those sneaky robgoblins robbed me! Can you help me <font color='#D9781A'>get my packages</font> back?\"",
  "locale:94299 [quest_title | Cobblestone Village | Chef: Package Recovery!] 'Chef: Package Recovery!'",
  "locale:94300 [quest_dialog | Cobblestone Village | Chef: Package Recovery!] 'Jonelle was ambushed by robgoblins! No wonder her delivery was late. And to make matters worse, the robgoblins scattered her packages all over the area! If you '",
  "locale:94301 [quest_dialog | Cobblestone Village | Chef: Package Recovery!] \"Thank you so much! I can finally relax with my packages back!<BR><BR>I'll definitely get this delivery to Simone, but first I think I'll take a little break... \"",
  "locale:94302 [quest_objective | Blackspore | Brawler: Delinquent Dilemma] \"Those hooligans keep stealing artifacts I brought from the ruins in Blackspore.<BR><BR>Find the <font color= '#D9781A'>Hooligan Delinquents</font> to the <font \"",
  "locale:94303 [quest_title | Blackspore | Brawler: Delinquent Dilemma] 'Brawler: Delinquent Dilemma'",
  "locale:94304 [quest_objective | Blackspore | Brawler: Delinquent Dilemma] 'Defeat the Hooligan Delinquents south of Jones to recover the artifacts they stole from him.'",
  "locale:94305 [quest_dialog | - | -] \"You're back? I had my doubts, but it looks like you know how to fight.<BR><BR>Here's your reward for returning the artifacts. I have more work for you, when you\""
