  "locale:395294 [quest_objective | - | Kart Driver: Burnt Rubber] \"Something is wrong with Antonio's kart. He wants you to talk to his crew pit boss, Crankle to see if you can help out.\"",
  "locale:395295 [quest_dialog | - | Kart Driver: Burnt Rubber] \"You ARE here! Listen to me...<BR><BR>I've tricked out my kart, I've been training night and day, and I've been studying all your moves. Give me one last race ag\"",
