  "locale:395298 [quest_objective | - | Kart Driver: Burnt Rubber] \"Linx has challenged you to a one on one race at Tangletrack Speedway. He thinks he's at the top of his game, so this will be his best hope of ever beating you. \"",
  "locale:395299 [quest_dialog | - | Kart Driver: Burnt Rubber] \"Congratulations. You're just plain better than me. <BR><BR>I guess there's still a silver lining. I may have failed to beat you, but I've become a much better r\"",
  "locale:395300 [quest_dialog | - | Kart Driver: Burnt Rubber] \"Honestly, I wish you the best. I'll stick to my promise and never challenge you again, but I hope I get the chance to compete against you again.<BR><BR>The only\"",
  "locale:395301 [quest_title | - | Kart Driver: The Keys to Victory] 'Kart Driver: The Keys to Victory'",
  "locale:395302 [quest_objective | - | Kart Driver: The Keys to Victory] 'Mirana Vega is the last racer ranked between you and Kade Carmichael, the current champion. Do what you can to set up a race against her.'",
  "locale:395303 [quest_dialog | - | Kart Driver: The Keys to Victory] \"Awesome! You're a life saver!<BR><BR>Wait a second. From that look in your eye, I'm guessing you had a hidden motive for helping me out. Ha! You're [*player*], \"",
  "locale:395304 [quest_dialog | - | Kart Driver: The Keys to Victory] \"I've been expecting you. Right now you're ranked third among all the racers in the circuit, and you're thinking you'll need to beat me before you can call out K\"",
  "locale:395306 [quest_objective | - | Kart Driver: The Keys to Victory] 'Mirana Vega has agreed to race against you at Tangletrack! Another victory will put you one step closer to winning the coveted Lightning Cup!'",
  "locale:395307 [quest_dialog | - | Kart Driver: The Keys to Victory] \"I wondered why Kade has been talking about you so much and now I know. Kade hasn't lost a race in years. He's that good.<BR><BR>Something tells me you might be \"",
  "locale:395308 [quest_dialog | - | Kart Driver: The Keys to Victory] 'Are you in a guild?'",
  "locale:395309 [quest_objective | - | Kart Driver: Miner's Guild Sponsorship] \"There's still one last thing to do before you can challenge Kade for the cup. You need another <font color='#d9781a'>sponsor</font>.<BR><BR>Only the best and mo\"",
  "locale:395310 [quest_title | - | Kart Driver: Miner's Guild Sponsorship] \"Kart Driver: Miner's Guild Sponsorship\"",
  "locale:395311 [npc_dialog | Tangletrack Speedway | Shamus Sootbender] \"A dwarf named Shamus Sootbender is at Tangletrack Speedway as a representative of the Miner's Guild. Mirana Vega thinks he sounds like a likely sponsor candidat\"",
