 "client_cluster_around_title": [
  "locale:415285 [quest_dialog | - | Bark at the Moon] 'My costume is going to be awesome!<BR><BR>Now I just need to learn how to sew...'",
  "locale:415286 [quest_dialog | Blackspore | Dem Bones] \"Do you know that there are a total of 204 bones in the pixie body? This costume only has 196! <BR><BR>No one's going to believe I'm a *real* skeleton.<BR><BR>I \"",
  "locale:415287 [quest_title | Blackspore | Dem Bones] 'Dem Bones'",
  "locale:415288 [quest_objective | Blackspore | Dem Bones] 'Skelly thinks his skeleton costume is completely inaccurate! He needs at least a few more bones to make it look believable. Collecting them from graves in Black'",
  "locale:415289 [quest_dialog | Blackspore | Dem Bones] 'Awesome!<BR><BR>These bones are going to make my skeleton costume the best ever!'",
  "locale:415290 [quest_dialog | - | Double, Double, Toil and Trouble] \"*cackles*<BR><BR>What a lovely little trick-or-treater we have here! Aren't you just precious, [*player*].<BR><BR>I have a special potion, just for you, if you \"",
  "locale:415291 [quest_title | - | Double, Double, Toil and Trouble] 'Double, Double, Toil and Trouble'",
  "locale:415292 [quest_objective | - | Double, Double, Toil and Trouble] 'Brunhilda (who is dressed as a witch) wants to make a wonderful new potion, but she needs some ingredients. Collect three rainleaf, three honeytwig, and three b'",
  "locale:415293 [quest_dialog | - | Double, Double, Toil and Trouble] 'A pinch of this and a dash of that...<BR><BR>Voila! A perfectly bubbling Halloween potion brewed just for you.'",
  "locale:415294 [quest_dialog | Memorial Caverns | Going Batty] \"Every good vampire has to have a nocturnal companion. It's too bad <font color='#D9781A'>bats</font> don't make good pets.<BR><BR>Maybe if you found a wild one \"",
  "locale:415295 [quest_title | - | Going Batty] 'Going Batty'",
  "locale:415296 [quest_objective | Memorial Caverns | Going Batty] \"Vladimir is dressed up as a vampire, but his costume is not complete without a pet bat! He's heard rumors that bats fly in the depths of the memorial caverns. H\"",
  "locale:415297 [quest_dialog | - | Going Batty] \"Great work! This bat should make my costume complete.<BR><BR>Now I hope it doesn't fly away...\"",
  "locale:415298 [quest_dialog | - | It's Alive!] \"Finklestein has feelings too, you know? Just because I'm a scary monster, doesn't mean I'm heartless.<BR><BR>I created my bride, Shelly, but she needs <font col\"",
  "locale:415299 [quest_title | - | It's Alive!] \"It's Alive!\"",
  "locale:415300 [quest_objective | - | It's Alive!] 'Finklestein has created a beautiful bride, but he needs essences from tormented spirits to bring her to life. He plans to reward you sweetly if you agree to hel'",
  "locale:415301 [quest_dialog | - | It's Alive!] 'This should be just the thing to bring my beautiful Shelly to life.<BR><BR>A sweet reward for your troubles!'",
  "locale:415302 [quest_dialog | Sanctuary | Bag Snatchers] \"Have you heard about the missing bags of candy?<BR><BR>Some folks blame ghosts and ghouls, but I'm sure it's just older kids nearby playing pranks.<BR><BR>If yo\"",
  "locale:415303 [quest_title | Sanctuary | Bag Snatchers] 'Bag Snatchers'",
  "locale:415304 [quest_objective | Sanctuary | Bag Snatchers] \"Some candy bags have been snatched from trick-or-treaters in Sanctuary. Could it be the work of ghosts and ghouls? Halloween Harry doesn't think so. He's asked \"",
  "locale:415305 [quest_dialog | Sanctuary | Bag Snatchers] \"I should have known it was Greyli. He's a little bonkers if you ask me... always going on about Sanctuary being haunted by ghosts.<BR><BR>Anyway, here's your re\"",
  "locale:415310 [quest_dialog | Sanctuary | Candy Gram] \"I'll have to keep a close eye on Greyli. He swears that there are ghosts in Sanctuary! Kek kek!<BR><BR>At least we got the candy back. The kids around town will\"",
  "locale:415311 [quest_title | Sanctuary | Candy Gram] 'Candy Gram'",
  "locale:415312 [quest_objective | Sanctuary | Candy Gram] 'Halloween Harry has asked you to return the bags of candy to the kids of Sanctuary.'",
  "locale:415313 [quest_dialog | Sanctuary | Candy Gram] \"Welcome back, [*player*]. The kids of Sanctuary think you're a hero! KEK!<BR><BR>Oh? Bella's brother has gone missing, you say?\"",
  "locale:415314 [quest_dialog | Sanctuary | A Formal Report] \"Bella is such a worry-wart!<BR><BR>I'm sure her brother Ethan is fine. He probably lost track of time while trick-or-treating. I know I would! Kekek!<BR><BR>Sti\"",
  "locale:415315 [quest_title | Sanctuary | A Formal Report] 'A Formal Report'",
  "locale:415316 [quest_objective | Sanctuary | A Formal Report] \"Just to be on the safe side, Halloween Harry would like you to report Ethan's disappearance to General Glowlight in Sanctuary.\"",
  "locale:415317 [quest_dialog | Sanctuary | A Trip to the Swamp] \"You must be here to help me recover my spectral spectacles.<BR><BR>General Glowlight said he'd send someone. I didn't expect them to show up so soon!\"",
  "locale:415318 [quest_objective | Blackspore | A Trip to the Swamp] \"That <font color='#D9781A'>Ethan</font> boy ran off to <font color='#D9781A'>Blackspore</font> with my spectral spectacles. They're not a toy!<BR><BR>Those spec\"",
  "locale:415319 [quest_title | Blackspore | A Trip to the Swamp] 'A Trip to the Swamp'",
  "locale:415320 [quest_objective | Blackspore | A Trip to the Swamp] 'Greyli Dustywings has asked you to help him recover his spectral spectacles from Ethan in Blackspore.'",
  "locale:415321 [quest_dialog | Blackspore | A Ghostly Discovery] \"What?! That Ethan boy broke my spectacles?<BR><BR>I know it's not your fault. In fact, with your help, I bet we can fix them.\"",
  "locale:415322 [quest_dialog | Blackspore | A Ghostly Discovery] \"My friend <font color='#D9781A'>Lucinda</font> is really good with ghostly gadgets.<BR><BR>She's been spending all her time near the oldest tomb in <font color=\"",
  "locale:415324 [quest_objective | Blackspore | A Ghostly Discovery] 'Greyli Dustywings has asked you to seek out Lucinda in Blackspore to see if she can fix the spectacles.'",
  "locale:415325 [quest_dialog | Blackspore | A Ghostly Discovery] 'Wonderful!<BR><BR>Now that I have the items, it should only take me a second to fix these spectacles....'",
  "locale:415326 [quest_dialog | Blackspore | A Ghostly Discovery] \"There we go! The <font color='#D9781A'>spectral spectacles</font> are good as new, I hope.<BR><BR><font color='#D9781A'>Try them on</font> and take a look aroun\"",
  "locale:415327 [quest_title | Blackspore | A Ghostly Discovery] 'A Ghostly Discovery'",
  "locale:415328 [quest_objective | Blackspore | A Ghostly Discovery] 'Lucinda would like you to try on the spectacles and let her know if you see any ghosts!'",
  "locale:415329 [quest_dialog | Blackspore | A Ghostly Discovery] \"You... you can see me? This must mean you'll be able to help!<BR><BR>I've been waiting an eternity for someone to come along...\"",
  "locale:415330 [quest_dialog | Blackspore | Guardians of the Tomb] \"The oldest tomb in Blackspore houses the Pumpkin Prince, a wicked undead soul.<BR><BR>His tomb has been shaking for days, and I think he's trying to enter the w\"",
  "locale:415331 [quest_title | Blackspore | Guardians of the Tomb] 'Guardians of the Tomb'",
  "locale:415332 [quest_objective | Blackspore | Guardians of the Tomb] 'Lord William is fearful that the Prince of the Underworld is trying to enter Sacred Grove. He needs you to seek out spectral guardians. They are the only ones w'",
  "locale:415333 [quest_dialog | Blackspore | Guardians of the Tomb] 'Do you have all the signets?<BR><BR>Perfect. Your heroics will be remembered by ghosts everywhere!'",
  "locale:415334 [quest_dialog | Blackspore | Sealed with a Signet] \"You've proven yourself to be helpful, [*player*], which is why I hope I can count on you for one final task.<BR><BR>In order to seal the Prince's tomb, you need\"",
  "locale:415335 [quest_title | Blackspore | Sealed with a Signet] 'Sealed with a Signet'",
  "locale:415336 [quest_objective | Blackspore | Sealed with a Signet] \"Lord William IV trusts you to place the signets on the Prince's headstone, forever sealing him into his grave!\"",
  "locale:415337 [quest_dialog | Blackspore | Lucinda] \"I came running as soon as I heard all the commotion. Are you okay?<BR><BR>I can't believe you came face to face with the Pumpkin Prince!\"",
