  "locale:438837 [ui | - | Time Left timer] 'Time Left: %1 Second'",
  "locale:438838 [npc_name | Sunstone Valley | Cactus Bandit] 'Cactus Bandit'",
  "locale:438839 [npc_dialog | Sunstone Valley | Cactus Bandit] \"It seems that while we was in Shrouded Glade, this gang called the <font color='#D9781A'>Skullz</font> took over <font color='#D9781A'>Rumble Ridge</font>. And \"",
  "locale:438840 [quest_title | Sunstone Valley | Sobering Homecoming] 'Sobering Homecoming'",
  "locale:438841 [quest_dialog | Sunstone Valley | Sobering Homecoming] 'After defeating the Gloam in Shrouded Glade, Dorn Geargrinder has returned to Sunstone Valley to find it overrun by a rival biker gang, the Skullz. Many Freewhe'",
  "locale:438842 [quest_dialog | Sunstone Valley | Sobering Homecoming] 'Thanks [*player*]. Gus never doubted me and I guess I shouldn’t either. Leading the Freewheelers to glory is the best way I can honor his memory.'",
  "locale:438843 [quest_dialog | Sunstone Valley | Bike Retrieval] \"What good's a bunch of Dwarven Bikers without bikes? While I was gone, those darned Skullz pitched our bikes over the ridge into <font color='#D9781A'>Sandscale\"",
  "locale:438844 [quest_title | Sunstone Valley | Bike Retrieval] 'Bike Retrieval'",
  "locale:438845 [quest_dialog | Sunstone Valley | Bike Retrieval] \"The Freewheelers are back together again and Dorn is almost ready to challenge the Skullz. Unfortunately while Dorn was away, the Skullz stole the Freewheelers'\"",
  "locale:438846 [npc_dialog | Sunstone Valley | Golmie Greasebeard] \"Woo wee, these hogs've seen better days. Well, a busy dwarf's a happy dwarf.\"",
  "locale:438847 [quest_dialog | Sunstone Valley | A Deal with a Dust Devil] \"I got my work cut out for me gettin' all of these bikes fixed up in time for Dorn’s challenge with the Skullz. Take these <font color='#D9781A'>parts</font> to \"",
  "locale:438848 [quest_title | Sunstone Valley | A Deal with a Dust Devil] 'A Deal with a Dust Devil'",
  "locale:438849 [quest_dialog | Sunstone Valley | A Deal with a Dust Devil] \"Golmie Greasebeard needs a few key parts to get Dorn Geargrinder's motorcycle running again. He has made a trading arrangement with the Robgoblins of Sunstone V\"",
  "locale:438850 [quest_dialog | Sunstone Valley | A Deal with a Dust Devil] \"So them dirty Robgoblins tried to pull a fast one on us. Good job puttin' them in their place. With these parts I’ll be able to get our bikes up and runnin' aga\"",
  "locale:438851 [quest_dialog | Sunstone Valley | Fixing Up a Sweet Ride] \"I got most of the repairs done, but it’s hard to do with all of the <font color='#D9781A'>Skullz</font> gettin' in the way. They been tryin' their best to keep \"",
  "locale:438852 [quest_title | Sunstone Valley | Fixing Up a Sweet Ride] 'Fixing Up a Sweet Ride'",
  "locale:438853 [quest_dialog | Sunstone Valley | Fixing Up a Sweet Ride] \"Golmie Greasebeard now has the parts he needs to fix Dorn's bike, but the Skullz don't want to risk losing the race and they plan to steal the parts before Golm\"",
  "locale:438854 [quest_dialog | Sunstone Valley | Fixing Up a Sweet Ride] \"It'll be good to get back on the old hog again. Thanks, [*player*].\"",
  "locale:438855 [quest_dialog | Sunstone Valley | Dorn Geargrinder] \"The Skullz have ruled unchallenged for too long.  Today that <font color='#D9781A'>ends</font> on the track. I’ll show this Skullz crony what a <font color='#D9\"",
  "locale:438856 [quest_title | Rumble Ridge | Race for Dominance] 'Race for Dominance'",
  "locale:438857 [quest_objective | Rumble Ridge | Race for Dominance] \"Having aided Golmie Greasebeard with suping up Dorn's ride, it's time to settle the score. The Skullz won't allow for a fair race so jump on the track and even \"",
  "locale:438858 [quest_dialog | Rumble Ridge | Race for Dominance] \"It's kind of funny, winning the race doesn’t feel like much of a victory with the challenge for the Rumbledome looming over my head. Good job [*player*], I woul\"",
  "locale:438859 [quest_dialog | Rumble Ridge | Race for Dominance] \"I don’t trust <font color='#D9781A'>Lieutenant Brock</font>. We saw in the race he has no honor. The second I enter the Rumbledome, the challenge starts. I don’\"",
  "locale:438860 [quest_title | Rumble Ridge | Welcome to the Rumbledome] 'Welcome to the Rumbledome'",
  "locale:438861 [quest_objective | Rumble Ridge | Welcome to the Rumbledome] 'The Rumbledome has long been the place where Dwarven Bikers could resolve conflicts definitively. Since the Skullz have taken over Rumble Ridge they have modifi'",
  "locale:438862 [quest_dialog | Rumble Ridge | Welcome to the Rumbledome] \"High voltage shock pads and fire pits I can see, but Gloam? How did the Skullz get Gloam into the Rumbledome?<BR><BR>It looks like we've a bit of work to do bef\"",
  "locale:438863 [quest_dialog | Rumble Ridge | Better Treads] \"As you've already learned, a good pair of boots offers little protection from those <font color='#D9781A'>High Voltage Shock Plates</font>. I bet I could fix so\"",
  "locale:438864 [quest_title | Rumble Ridge | Better Treads] 'Better Treads'",
  "locale:438865 [quest_objective | Rumble Ridge | Better Treads] 'One of the traps the Skullz have added to the Rumbledome are high voltage shock plates. Golmie thinks that the spines of the local cacti are resistant to electr'",
  "locale:438866 [quest_dialog | Rumble Ridge | Better Treads] \"Getting' into a fight with a cactus is one way to collect cactus spines. These new set of treads should make shock plates less shockin'. I was able to make a pa\"",
  "locale:438867 [quest_dialog | Rumble Ridge | Better Threads] \"Our best leather jackets don’t provide much protection from those <font color='#D9781A'>Fire Pits</font>. I’d bet my best wrench that if I made a jacket coated \"",
  "locale:438868 [quest_title | Rumble Ridge | Better Threads] 'Better Threads'",
  "locale:438869 [quest_objective | Rumble Ridge | Better Threads] 'The Skullz have added fire pits to the Rumbledome. Manguana spit is very resistant to the hot temperatures. Collect Manguana spit and give it to Golmie Greasebe'",
  "locale:438870 [quest_dialog | Rumble Ridge | Better Threads] \"I'm ain't no sissy pixie fashion designer, but I make a mean jacket if I do say so myself. One mean enough to withstand those fire pits!\"",
  "locale:438871 [quest_dialog | Sunstone Valley | House Cleaning] \"Done all I can to deal with them traps the Skullz've added. Go give <font color='#D9781A'>Headmaster Merk</font> a holler and ask him how to deal with the <font\"",
  "locale:438872 [quest_title | Sunstone Valley | House Cleaning] 'House Cleaning'",
  "locale:438873 [quest_objective | Sunstone Valley | House Cleaning] 'With new gear tailored to deal with the traps in the Rumbledome, talk to Headmaster Merk to find a way to purge the Gloam influence.'",
  "locale:438874 [quest_dialog | Sunstone Valley | House Cleaning] \"With the Gloam influence gone and this new gear to handle the Skullz' traps, I feel ready to end this. Good job, [*player*]!\""
 ],
