  "locale:385038 [quest_dialog | - | Fizzberry] 'Confused, my friend? You need to get some well water and then plant that seed so we can see if it grows into a poisonous plant or not.'",
  "locale:385040 [quest_dialog | Haunted Mines | Dwarven Expertise] 'Iliya and I think the Haunted Mines used to be mined for crystals! You know, the kind the dwarves use to power their city an race karts? Those crystals also wer'",
  "locale:385043 [quest_dialog | - | Dwarven Expertise] \"Why would a Shadowtalon ninja ever have been in the mine? That's an interesting clue, but... wait... oh my... I must investigate...<BR><BR>Oh, sorry! I sort of \"",
  "locale:385044 [quest_dialog | - | Dwarven Expertise] 'We were right! There was charged crystal residue all over the rock you brought in!<BR><BR>For that to happen, the crystal they came from must have been huge, an'",
  "locale:385045 [quest_title | - | Dwarven Expertise] 'Dwarven Expertise'",
  "locale:385046 [quest_objective | - | Dwarven Expertise] 'Iliya wants you to inquire about a large crystal from Vrock Gravelfist.'",
  "locale:385047 [quest_dialog | - | Dwarven Expertise] \"A GIANT crystal? No, I never heard of anything like that coming out of the old mining outpost. It's too bad no one survived. If only there was someone who was t\"",
  "locale:385048 [quest_dialog | - | -] 'Have you collected the reports I asked for yet? I really need them as soon as possible.'",
  "locale:385050 [quest_objective | - | Block Loblog's Bog Log] \"A dwarven writer named <font color='#D9781A'>Block Loblog</font> died at the outpost before it was destroyed, but he kept a log on their operations for a book h\"",
  "locale:385051 [quest_title | - | Block Loblog's Bog Log] \"Block Loblog's Bog Log\"",
  "locale:385052 [quest_dialog | - | Block Loblog's Bog Log] \"Vrock thinks that Block Loblog's log could help us find clues as to what this mystery is all about.\"",
  "locale:385053 [quest_dialog | - | Block Loblog's Bog Log] \"It says they had uncovered the biggest crystal he'd ever seen, but his notes stop before they finished digging it up...<BR><BR>Where could Lukov still be? He sh\"",
  "locale:385054 [quest_objective | Sunken Graveyard | Consumed by the Past] \"Can you go search for <font color='#D9781A'>Lukov</font>? <BR><BR>Maybe he got wind of what you were up to in the <font color='#D9781A'>sunken graveyard</font> \"",
  "locale:385055 [quest_title | - | Consumed by the Past] 'Consumed by the Past'",
  "locale:385056 [quest_objective | - | Consumed by the Past] 'Iliya is worried about Lukov and wants you to find him.'",
  "locale:385057 [quest_dialog | - | Consumed by the Past] \"No!!  This can't be...\"",
  "locale:385058 [quest_objective | - | Blue is Good, Red is Bad] \"Okay. It should be ready now. See how quick it was?<BR><BR><font color='#d9781a'>Head back to where you planted the sample</font> and <font color='#d9781a'>see \"",
  "locale:385059 [quest_title | - | Blue is Good, Red is Bad] 'Blue is Good, Red is Bad'",
  "locale:385060 [quest_objective | - | Blue is Good, Red is Bad] \"Phyll wants you to see what kind of flower grew from the seed you planted. Let's hope it's blue and Jack is safe!\"",
  "locale:385061 [quest_dialog | - | Blue is Good, Red is Bad] \"You saved Jack!<BR><BR>I can't thank you enough! Jack thanks you too, don't ya little Jackie-poo?\"",
  "locale:385062 [quest_dialog | Isle of Tears | Dead Ends] \"What am I going to do? That thing he found must have done something to him; he'd never attack you like that! <BR><BR>Ok... I need to do some research on the Isl\"",
  "locale:385063 [quest_title | - | Dead Ends] 'Dead Ends'",
  "locale:385064 [quest_objective | - | Dead Ends] 'Report back to Rumor Duskveil.'",
  "locale:385065 [quest_dialog | - | Rumor Duskveil] \"Oh my... that's fascinating news! <BR><BR>The development with Lukov is troubling, and will need to be watched, but I wonder what those ninjas got their hands o\"",
  "locale:385066 [npc_dialog | - | -] 'Mind your own business, outsider.'",
  "locale:385068 [quest_objective | Shrouded Glade | Check on Jack] 'Phyll wants you to check on the seed you planted to see if it grew into a poisonous flower.'",
  "locale:385069 [quest_objective | Shrouded Glade | Check on Jack] 'See if a flower grew'",
  "locale:385070 [quest_objective | Shrouded Glade | Check on Jack] \"If a blue flower grew, Jack's ok. If a red flower grew... you'd better go check on Jack!\"",
  "locale:385071 [quest_objective | Shrouded Glade | Check on Jack] 'Check on Jack'",
  "locale:385072 [quest_objective | Shrouded Glade | Check on Jack] 'Make sure that Jack is ok!'",
  "locale:385074 [quest_objective | Shrouded Glade | Phyll] \"You'd better go see if Phyll knows how to reverse Jack's... problem.\"",
  "locale:385075 [quest_objective | Shrouded Glade | A Purilla Plant] 'Gather a purilla plant'"
 ],
