  "locale:101413 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Feminine Touch] 'Yum! Ok thanks!'",
  "locale:101414 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Feminine Touch] 'My most valuable possession? What would make you think I would just tell you? What are you trying to steal from me or something?'",
  "locale:101415 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Feminine Touch] 'Yancy Gilbert sent me.'",
  "locale:101416 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Feminine Touch] 'Oh, well that is different entirely... My most valuable possession would have to be my pearl necklace! My grandmother passed it down to me. I cherish it dearly!'",
