  "locale:5100915 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Tides of Change] \"Oh the Cray... there was a time when they were a sign of good luck, now they're out of control!<BR>I fear Mayor Gilly may be correct in assuming there's a conne\"",
  "locale:5100916 [quest_objective | Seaside | Know your Enemy] \"I've noticed that the Cray became much more aggressive not too long after Orchid Eventide began working in the abandoned dojo. See what you can learn about them\"",
  "locale:5100917 [quest_title | Seaside | Know your Enemy] 'Know your Enemy'",
  "locale:5100918 [quest_objective | Seaside | Know your Enemy] 'The Cray have been growing more aggressive for some time, but Seaspray suspects Orchid Eventide is secretly pushing them into a frenzy. Learn more about the Cra'",
  "locale:5100919 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Know your Enemy] 'The Cray are behaving like mindless attack drones? Something is definitely not right. The pollution problem must be a cover up for something more sinister.'",
  "locale:5100920 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Meet Crabcake] 'The way you describe the Cray in battle sounds very different than the way they once were. There are rumors of a Cray unaffected by this sickness who lives unde'",
  "locale:5100921 [quest_title | Seaside | Meet Crabcake] 'Meet Crabcake'",
  "locale:5100922 [quest_objective | Seaside | Meet Crabcake] \"Seaspray believes the pollution on the shores of Seaside isn't the true cause of the Cray aggressiveness. Locate the friendly Cray rumored to live below the boa\"",
  "locale:5100923 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Meet Crabcake] 'What is this? No [*player_race*] has ever shown kindness to me before. This offer of friendship is the first good omen the Cray have seen since our pearls turne'",
  "locale:5100924 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Cleansing the Pearls] 'I have been hiding down here watching the the Cray fight the people of Seaside for a long time.<BR>I thought there was hope for peace until a Ninja visited our '",
  "locale:5100925 [quest_title | Seaside | Cleansing the Pearls] 'Cleansing the Pearls'",
  "locale:5100926 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Stemming the Tide] 'It seems after a Ninja visited the Cray Caves recently all their pearls turned black, something the Cray consider to be a bad omen. Reversing this corruption ma'",
  "locale:5100927 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Stemming the Tide] 'Thank you [*player*]! The pearls you have purified will help many of the Cray return to their senses.'",
  "locale:5100928 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Stemming the Tide] 'The King of Low Tide is the only Cray with access to every pearl. But to turn every single one black... he must be corrupted by the Gloam! Please help defeat hi'",
  "locale:5100929 [quest_title | Seaside | Stemming the Tide] 'Stemming the Tide'",
  "locale:5100930 [quest_objective | Seaside | Stemming the Tide] 'Crabcake believes the Gloam must have corrupted the King of Low Tide to turn against his people and change all the pearls black. Defeat him to free the Cray!'",
  "locale:5100931 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Stemming the Tide] '[*player*], you have freed the Cray from the Gloam! Perhaps if the people of Seaside continue to clean up the beaches there can be peace between the Cray and Se'",
  "locale:5100932 [quest_dialog | Seaside | History of the Dojo] 'The mysterious Ninja must have come from the Flying Dragon Dojo. Kai was once the master there, but he refuses to speak of why he left. Maybe the Great Koodini '",
  "locale:5100933 [quest_title | Seaside | History of the Dojo] 'History of the Dojo'",
  "locale:5100934 [quest_objective | Seaside | History of the Dojo] 'The Gloam influence has been removed from the Cray, but Crabcake is still concerned about the mysterious Ninja. Speak to the Great Koodini to learn about Kai an'",
  "locale:5100935 [quest_dialog | Seaside | History of the Dojo] 'Yes, it was the actions of rebellious students that brought about the summoning of Nekark. Ty and the remaining Ninja were able to seal it away, but it seems th'",
  "locale:5100936 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Ghosts of the Past] 'The people are convinced the ghosts haunting Seaside are fallen students of the Flying Dragon, but I refuse to believe it. Defeat some of them in battle and per'",
  "locale:5100937 [quest_title | Seaside | Ghosts of the Past] 'Ghosts of the Past'",
  "locale:5100938 [quest_objective | Seaside | Ghosts of the Past] 'Kai believes there is more to the ghost ninjas than meets the eye. Defeat some of them in battle to see if they truly were once students of the Flying Dragon Do'",
  "locale:5100939 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Ghosts of the Past] 'They were using Deadly Blow! That’s something that has never been taught in our Dojo. Thanks to you the honor of the Flying Dragons has been defended. But then,'",
  "locale:5100940 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Not the Ghosts You're Looking For] 'Now that we have restored the honor of the fallen Dojo students, the real villian must be exposed. Speak with the Great Koodini. He may know more about their or'",
  "locale:5100941 [quest_title | Seaside | Not the Ghosts You're Looking For] \"Not the Ghosts You're Looking For\"",
  "locale:5100942 [quest_objective | Seaside | Not the Ghosts You're Looking For] 'The fighting style of the ghost ninjas did not match what was taught in the Flying Dragon Dojo. Kai wants you to speak to the Great Koodini to learn more about '",
  "locale:5100943 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Not the Ghosts You're Looking For] \"The Gloam has been masquerading as my students. You've done a great service in clearing the name of the Flying Dragon Clan. I am in your debt, [*player*].\"",
  "locale:5100944 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Not the Ghosts You're Looking For] 'It is time that we take back the Dojo from the Gloam. Orchid Eventide seems to be controlling Nekark from the caves below. I’ll meet you there and we will put a'",
  "locale:5100945 [quest_title | Seaside | Unwanted Guests] 'Unwanted Guests'",
  "locale:5100946 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Unwanted Guests] 'With the ghost ninjas haunting Seaside exposed as manifestations of the Gloam, Kai is ready to removing its presence from the Dojo and put an end to Orchid Even'",
  "locale:5100947 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Stop Orchid Eventide] 'Orchid Eventide is recovering from the Gloam’s influence. But we have a greater evil to deal with now. We must defeat Nekark before he destroys Seaside!'",
  "locale:5100948 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Stop Orchid Eventide] 'Now that the Gloam has been removed from Orchid Eventide, the shame of the Flying Dragon Dojo - the Nekark - has been fully unleashed. We must defeat this monst'",
